  "description": "meme-id: clint-eastwood-and-michelle-obama; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man with a monkey holding a bottle, overlaid with the text 'clint eastwood and michelle obama'. This juxtaposition is a racist trope that equates Black individuals with primates, a harmful and degrading stereotype historically used to demean and dehumanize Black people. The meme uses the visual of a monkey to mock Michelle Obama, who is Black, by implying she is 'animal-like' or 'less than human'. This is a direct attack based on race, fitting the definition of hateful content. The inclusion of Clint Eastwood, a white man, in the same text may serve to imply a contrast or to further emphasize the racialized comparison, reinforcing the harmful message. The overall intent is to demean Michelle Obama through racist imagery and text, making it a hateful meme.",
